\f1\b0 \cf4 \cb1 \strokec4 \
\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf4 \cb3 Successfully implemented a 
\f0\b \cf2 \strokec2 **pre-registered, hypothesis-testing experiment**
