\f0\b \cf2 \cb3 \strokec2 ## Core Principle
\f1\b0 \cf4 \cb1 \strokec4 \
\

\f0\b \cf2 \cb3 \strokec2 **This experiment does NOT claim to prove the Riemann Hypothesis.**
\f1\b0 \cf4 \strokec4  It tests statistical scaling hypotheses under pre-registered mappings. A \cf6 \strokec6 `PASS`\cf4 \strokec4  status only means the observed match is statistically unlikely under uniform random hypotheses\'97nothing more.\cb1 \
