\f0\b \cf2 \cb3 \strokec2 ### 5. Null Model (Anti-Numerology Gate)
\f1\b0 \cf4 \cb1 \strokec4 \
\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf4 \cb3 For each trial:\cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf5 \cb3 \strokec5 -\cf4 \strokec4  Generate uniform random pseudo-gamma values (same range as observed)\cb1 \
\cf5 \cb3 \strokec5 -\cf4 \strokec4  Test same mapping families\cb1 \
\cf5 \cb3 \strokec5 -\cf4 \strokec4  Record best relative error\cb1 \
\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf4 \cb3 Compute p_value = fraction(null_best_err \uc0\u8804  observed_best_err)\cb1 \
\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f0\b \cf2 \cb3 \strokec2 **Interpretation:**
\f1\b0 \cf4 \strokec4  If p_value \uc0\u8804  0.05, the observed match is unlikely by chance.\cb1 \
